# Configuration of /etc/init.d/moinmoin
#
# The init script runs MoinMoin wikis with the standalone server of
# MoinMoin (no web server needed, or behind a reverse proxy). It is not
# needed if the wikis run with Apache mod_wsgi, uWSGI, gunicorn, CGI or
# FastCGI.
#
# INSTANCES is a space separated list of wikis, each one written as
#     NAME:DIRECTORY:PORT[:INTERFACE[:USER]]
# NAME       a short name (used for the pid file)
# DIRECTORY  the wiki instance directory (contains wikiconfig.py), see moin-mkwiki
# PORT       TCP port of the wiki server
# INTERFACE  address to listen on, default 127.0.0.1 (use 0.0.0.0 for all)
# USER       user running the wiki (owner of the data), default www-data
#
# Example:
#INSTANCES="mywiki:/srv/moin/mywiki:8080 docs:/srv/moin/docs:8081:0.0.0.0:moin"
INSTANCES=""
